### 6. **UI Display of Delivery Status**

The UI layer handles rendering with a smart animation system in `/Users/stjepandzojic/projects/element-x-ios/ElementX/Sources/Screens/Timeline/View/Style/TimelineStyler.swift`:

```swift
@State private var adjustedDeliveryStatus: TimelineItemDeliveryStatus?

// When delivery status changes
.onChange(of: timelineItem.properties.deliveryStatus) { _, newStatus in
    if case .sendingFailed = newStatus {
        // Delay showing failure so users see "sending" briefly before "failed"
        task = Task {
            try? await Task.sleep(for: .milliseconds(700))
            if !Task.isCancelled {
                adjustedDeliveryStatus = newStatus
            }
        }
    } else {
        // Immediately update for .sending and .sent states
        task?.cancel()
        adjustedDeliveryStatus = newStatus
    }
}
```

